From 434a900fc9b60cc59d60ac6ef1502b38d55dbc0b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cedric Roux <cedric.roux@eurecom.fr>
Date: Fri, 10 Apr 2026 15:38:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 13/21] NR-DC: transfer bearer to secondary DU

Plus some modifications here and there.

Signed-off-by: Cedric Roux <cedric.roux@eurecom.fr>
---
